# Keeps the build context to source and poms. Without this, every module's target/ directory - and
# the .git history - is uploaded to the daemon on every build, which is slow and puts build output
# from the host into a build that is supposed to be hermetic.
**/target/
.git/
.idea/
.mvn/
**/*.iml
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings/
**/.factorypath
